+# Wire Format
+
+The project's current recorded decision for the wire serialisation format is CBOR (Concise Binary Object Representation), chosen for its stronger type safety and more predictable schema handling. The decision was recorded on 2026-09-26 in the project's decision log for the serialization layer.
